    {
      "date": "Oct 08 2026",
      "text": "Order entered by The Chief Justice: Upon consideration of the application of counsel for the applicant, it is ordered that the October 7, 2026 judgement of the United States Court of Appeals for the Fourth Circuit, case No. 26-2230, is hereby stayed pending further order of the undersigned or of the Court. It is further ordered that a response to the application be filed on or before Saturday, October 10, 2026, by 5 p.m. (EDT).",
